  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Orion at the centre",
      "items": [
        "Soma and Kalam ship no server code: each is an Orion package of channels, workflows, connectors, SQL and wasm plugins, applied at boot",
        "The central Orion node serves the site's API and the runner gate, and runs the five clocks as cluster singletons",
        "Every runner is an Orion node of its own; a match is an Orion workflow calling the tb-ants plugin and model_infer per seat",
        "Orion UI operates the central node through its admin API: channels, packages, plugins and live metrics"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "One way in",
      "items": [
        "Caddy publishes the only ports: :443 for the site, :8443 for the console, :3443 for Grafana",
        "The console and Grafana let in only a site admin: their gates ask Soma's /v1/admin-check",
        "Runners call the gate like any browser, at https://tinybrains.dev/v1/runner/*"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Bytes skip the VM",
      "items": [
        "The browser PUTs an ONNX model and its manifest straight to R2 on presigned URLs, and GETs replays the same way",
        "Runners GET models by digest with a read-only token and PUT replays on gate-signed URLs",
        "Soma runs no model: its admit clock only HEADs the upload and reads the manifest"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "State",
      "items": [
        "Cloud SQL holds the platform schema and orion_state; gate routes connect as runner_gate",
        "Cluster Redis is never evicted; the response cache evicts volatile-lru",
        "Each runner keeps its Orion state in memory and rebuilds it at boot"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Operations",
      "items": [
        "Alloy sends metrics, logs and spans to Prometheus, Loki and Tempo; Grafana alerts post to Discord",
        "Every image is a release from ghcr.io/tiny-brains; plugins are signed with the deployment's own trust key",
        "soma-bootstrap runs once before Soma: schema, roles, engine digest and cartridge"
      ]
    }
  ]
